      "title": "Unbalanced / Malformed Posted Journals",
      "description": "Count of POSTED journals violating Phase24 journal integrity rules, including fewer than two entries, missing debit side, missing credit side, or debit/credit sum mismatch (includes MALFORMED_JOURNAL and UNBALANCED_JOURNAL). A zero-entry POSTED journal is counted even though numeric sums are both zero. MUST ALWAYS BE ZERO.",
